BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-19T22:30:00&endDate=2026-09-20T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Saturday 19 September\, after 2330\, no westbound service between Wandsworth Road and Clapham Junction. Trains are diverted to/from Battersea Park for SOUTHERN connections to/from Clapham Junction.
