BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-20T03:30:00&endDate=2026-09-20T07:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Sunday 20 September\, until 0800\, no service between Sydenham and West Croydon. Customers should use local buses or trams via any reasonable route. First Trains:\r\nHighbury & Islington to West Croydon 0817\; New Cross Gate to West Croydon 0747\; West Croydon to Highbury & Islington 0848. In addition\, SOUTHERN services will be replaced by buses between London Bridge and East Croydon\, calling at Norwood Junction only.
